    "title": "Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera",
    "description": "<b>Beauty camera & Selfie Camera is the free perfect beauty camera and photo editor app with all powerful features. With Beauty Camera and Selfie Camera, you can instantly take incredible photos and videos with live stickers, face and body retouch, camera filters, makeup effects.</b> Just one tap to apply real-time filters, stickers and beauty to capture every moment.\r\n<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera is also a makeup camera, photo collage maker app and music video editor to offer various free features and editing tools:</b> daily updated animated effects, smooth skin, slim face, remove acne or blemish, retouch eye shape, plus teeth whitening, reshape body, face tune your selfies in seconds. \r\n\r\n<b>Free download and use Beauty Camera - Selfie Camera, HD camera app.</b> One click to snap and share the best selfies and short videos to social platforms! \ud83d\udcf8\ud83c\udfa5\r\n\r\n\u2b50 <b>Beauty Camera & Selfie Camera with Real-time Beauty effects, Face Tune</b>\r\n\u2714 <b>Smooth skin:</b> use exclusive skin smoothing makeover tool for perfect skin\r\n\u2714 <b>Teeth whitening:</b> teeth whitening enhances the natural beauty of your smile\r\n\u2714 <b>Reshape face:</b> change your face shape and create your custom beauty style\r\n\u2714 <b>Acne Remover:</b> Tap to remove acne, pimple, blemish, etc. and get smooth skin\r\n\u2714 <b>Perfect Eyes:</b> Enlarge and brighten your eyes and remove dark circles\r\n\u2714 <b>Makeup looks:</b> You can adjust beauty and makeup to suit you\r\n\u2714 <b>Selfie Editor:</b> Remove pimples, acne, wrinkle, dark circle. Reshape cheekbones, nose, chin, jaw, forehead.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc93 <b>Various Stickers, Filters, Light Makeup Looks</b>\r\n* A large number of unique stickers that can easily suit selfies and make your photos funny. \r\n* Face live camera stickers and AR stickers like cute animal stickers, tattoo sticker, cat ears sticker, beard stickers, flowery crowns sticker, hilarious poop-emoji hats sticker etc.\r\n* Over 300 themed filters and gorgeous effects to help you create the atmosphere you want with ease.\r\n* Sweet Selfie - Sweet Snap camera use various popular makeup selfie effects and facial recognition stickers make your selfies mesmerizing.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Amazing Collages, Effects & Frames</b>\r\n* <b>Free Collage Maker & Sweet camera</b> - amazing collage or frames for your favorite picture, try photo grid, free preset templates & layouts, freestyle collage, scrapbook for photos.\r\n* <b>Selfie Editor & Makeup camera</b> - face & nose shaper, foundation, lipstick, blush, contour, highlight, concealer, hair dye. \r\n* <b>Accessories</b> - sunglasses, hats, glasses, eyewear, hairbands, earrings, necklaces in Beauty camera.\r\n* <b>Sweet Face Camera & Music video</b> - shoot videos with trendy effects and various music. Duet videos for Instagram or tik tok.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfac <b>Professional Photo Editor and Video Cutter</b>\r\n* <b>Powerful photo editor:</b> Added new filters, texts, stickers for images & live cam that will engage your followers and wow your friends.\r\n* <b>Blur and Remover:</b> Add depth to your photos with blur tool. Remove people, buildings and any other unwanted objects.\r\n* <b>More portrait edit:</b> Crop to a certain ratio, straighten, rotate and change your background shape. \r\n* <b>Video editor:</b> From video shooting to post-editing with music, and easy Video Trimmer.\r\n\r\nBeauty Camera is a powerful beauty selfie camera and photo/video editor. Let\u2019s snap wonderful pictures and videos with trendy filters, stunning collages, decoration stickers and text, frames, animated effects and more! \ud83d\udc8e\ud83c\udf07",
